Приложение предназначено для просмотра статистики тренировок в фитнес-клубе.

DexBee анализирует результаты тренировки и выдает рекомендации:
- Как тренироваться эффективно и в комфортном режиме (без перегрузок);
- Как похудеть в 1,5 раза быстрей;
- Как развить свое сердце и защититься от стресса и болезней;
- Как работать в оптимальном режиме на массу и силу.

Отсканируйте QR-код в клубе на ресепшене, чтобы начать тренироваться с DexBee.

Если вы уже тренируетесь с DexBee, то получите ссылку для входа у тренера или на ресепшене.

Take your Sorare experience to the next level with the SorareData mobile app! Track your Sorare results on-the-go, and get real-time notifications when your players make an impact.

Download the app to manage your membership, see detailed match information with player stats, including fantasy points broken down by decisive and all-around scores. The app also includes player scouting and market tools to help Sorare managers discover which players' cards they may want to purchase, and see the market values of those cards in all scarcities.

GAMEWEEK CENTER

- See scores for all matches in every Sorare gameweek and filter them by only live or upcoming games, those with lined up players from your teams, favorite games only or games with gallery players;
- Each match shows every player who featured with their corresponding SO5 scores, including indications if they had a decisive action;

LINEUPS

- See all of your submitted SO5 lineups for the current or past gameweeks, and a summary of rewards that could be won;
- Each lineup indicates how many fantasy points it has scored, where it is in the standings, what possible rank it could finish, what tier of card it is eligible to win based on current standings, and how many points are needed for a better reward.

TOURNAMENT RANKINGS

- Live standings are shown for all contests on Sorare;
- Expand the standings to see detailed lineups with exactly which cards were used by every Sorare manager;

MANAGER WATCHLISTS

- Search for a specific manager to see how they are doing in the current gameweek, or use your manager watchlists to track multiple managers at once.

PLAYER SCORES

- Examine player scores at each SO5 position broken down by SO5 region or specific domestic league, including those who are U23 eligible.

Set notifications to be alerted when matches start, reach halftime and end, or when players have decisive actions such as goals or assists.

SCOUT

- Manage your player and manager watchlists, easily see the top performing players of the gameweek, and examine trending players.
- Use advanced filters with our player rankings to see the best players by position, league or age range, and see their latest valuations.
- Set price alerts to be notified when a specific player’s card is available under a certain price.

Users can also search individual players to unlock power features, including:

- Overview tab that has L5/L15/L40 scores, current card supply for all scarcities, best market prices and valuations;
- SO5 Scores that includes a player’s score graph and detailed information from each match, such as minutes played, detailed position, decisive and all-around scores;
- Price section showing market indices and price graph, with the ability see details on every transaction; users can also adjust the information to their preferred scarcities and currencies;
- Live Market data to see all available cards on the market for each player, including auctions and secondary market offerings, for all open and completed transactions, plus filters for specific date ranges;
- Similar players to examine other options based on their L15 average

MARKET

- Live auctions, offers and bundle tabs with detailed information including each player’s L5/L15/L40 averages, their playing time during each span, fixture in the next gameweek, recent sales prices, floor price on the secondary market, current high bid and next bid price;

MEMBERSHIPS 
Subscriptions will be applied to your iTunes account at the end of the trial, if applicable, or after your confirmation. Subscriptions will automatically renew unless canceled within 24-hours before the end of the current period. You can cancel anytime during a trial with your iTunes account settings. Any unused portion of a free trial will be forfeited if you purchase a subscription during the trial. Manage your subscriptions in your iTunes account or in the settings tab after purchase.
